{"id": "11th_tamil_u4_q002", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "prose_thamizhaga_kalvi_varalaaru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "purananooru_education_quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘உற்றுழி உதவியும் உறுபொருள் கொடுத்தும் / பிற்றைநிலை முனியாது கற்றல் நன்றே’ - இவ்வடிகள் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள சங்க நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அகநானூறு", "B": "புறநானூறு (பாடல் 183)", "C": "நற்றிணை", "D": "கலித்தொகை"}, "explanation": "ஆசிரியருக்கு இடர் வந்தபோது உதவியும், பெருஞ்செல்வம் கொடுத்தும் கற்பதே சிறப்பு என்பதை விளக்கும் இப்பாடல் புறநானூற்றில் (பாடல் 183) ஆரியப்படை கடந்த நெடுஞ்செழியனால் பாடப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which Sangam anthology is the classic educational hymn 'Utruzhi uthaviyum uruporul koduthum...' found?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Akananooru", "B": "Purananooru (Poem 183)", "C": "Natrinai", "D": "Kalithogai"}, "explanation": "It is found in Purananooru 183, sung by the Pandyan king Aariyappadai Kadantha Nedunchezhian."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 78, "chapter": null