{"id": "11th_tamil_u4_q071", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "poem_pillaikkoodam_natrinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "meaning_madai_maantru", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘உண்ணுநீர் இன்மையின் ஒழுக நீர் நுண்துகில் / மடைமாண்றன்ன என் மகள்...’ - இதில் ‘மடைமாண்றன்ன’ என்பதன் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அகன்ற மடை", "B": "உடைந்த அணை", "C": "நீரை வடிகட்டும் வடிகலன் போல (வடிகட்டியது போல)", "D": "பாசனக் கால்வாய்"}, "explanation": "நுண்ணிய ஆடையால் வடிகட்டியது போன்ற தூய்மையான நல்லொழுக்கத்தைக் கொண்டவள் என் மகள் என்று செவிலித்தாய் போற்றுகிறாள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the verse 'Madaimaanranna en magal', what classical metaphorical meaning is expressed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Wide sluice gate", "B": "Breached embankment", "C": "Like fine water filtered pure through silk fabric (Purity of conduct)", "D": "Irrigation channel"}, "explanation": "It expresses pristine purity of character, like water filtered through fine muslin cloth."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 84, "chapter":