{"id": "11th_tamil_u4_q148", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "grammar_padaippaakka_uthigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "muran_definition_paradox", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘சுடும் பனி’, ‘இனிக்கும் கசப்பு’, ‘வாழும் பிணம்’ போன்ற சொற்றொடர்களில் அமைந்துள்ள படைப்பாக்க உத்தி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொன்மம்", "B": "குறியீடு", "C": "படிமம்", "D": "முரண் (Irony / Paradox / Antithesis)"}, "explanation": "ஒன்றற்கொன்று நேரெதிரான இரு முரண்பட்ட சொற்களையோ கருத்துகளையோ இணைத்து ஆழ்ந்த உணர்வை வெளிப்படுத்துவது 'முரண்' உத்தியாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which literary device is deployed in contradictory poetic oxymorons like 'Burning frost', 'Sweet bitterness', and 'Living corpse'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Myth", "B": "Symbol", "C": "Image", "D": "Muran (Oxymoron / Paradox / Antithesis)"}, "explanation": "Muran (Oxymoron/Antithesis) yokes contradictory terms to spark poetic insight."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 89, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 4,